CLASS com/xk72/proxy/ssl/class_1402 com/xk72/proxy/ssl/MaybeSSLProxyingServer
	COMMENT [inferred] the interface SSLHttpProxyHandler tests its own proxy server against to find
	COMMENT out whether a connection should be decrypted. Implemented only by
	COMMENT SSLProxyingSocketProxyServer. Charles 4 had no name for it.
	METHOD method_3756 registerConnection (Lcom/xk72/proxy/ProxyEvent;Lcom/xk72/proxy/Connection;)Z
		COMMENT [inferred] records the connection and returns whether it falls inside the SSL proxying
		COMMENT locations, so the server can later interrupt exactly the connections whose answer
		COMMENT would change if the settings changed.
		ARG 1 proxyEvent
		ARG 2 connection
	METHOD method_3755 unregisterConnection (Lcom/xk72/proxy/ProxyEvent;)V
		ARG 1 proxyEvent
